/E (This project is an AI-powered platform called MillorIA. It is designed to support individuals with Mild Cognitive Impairment \(MCI\). MCI leads to gradual declines in memory, attention, language and executive function. The platform aims to help by slowing down or stabilizing progression in symptoms.)
