/E (I will not create medical or a clinical invention.The platform may be used to support MCI, but does not replace professional treatment. Although this platform may have a positive effect on people I will not advertise it as a medical invention. This is to avoid the risk that users may view the platform as a replacement for professional treatment and for that reason not seek out professional treatment. This platform is not based on enough clinical research to replace any legitimate form of treatment.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
363 0 obj
<<
