/P 1258 0 R
/E (I will not solve all accessibility challenges for all impairments. This research does not aim to solve all accessibility challenges for every type of impairment. Its focus is specifically on people with Mild Cognitive Impairment \(MCI\), rather than on all possible disabilities. That said, the platform will comply with basic accessibility standards, meaning it remains accessible to a broad audience larger than the primary target group.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
