/E (MillorIA is considered done when the platform has a carefully thought-out, accessibility-focused design that is based on research into the needs of the target group. It has been developed in line with accessibility standards and implemented as a working prototype with a scalable database and an integrated AI model.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [17]
>>
