403 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 240 0 R
/E (More importantly, WCAG does not consider that older adults differ from people with disabilities in how they use technology. Many older users are not even aware of the assistive technologies embedded in operating systems and browsers that could help them navigate the web. And without this awareness, they cannot take advantage of the built-in support designed to improve accessibility. \(Wu, S et al 2021\))
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
