/E (Age-related motor skill decline can make precise interactions difficult, increasing the likelihood of errors. For users with MCI, such errors may lead to confusion, anxiety or loss of confidence. These guidelines reduce the physical effort required to interact with the interface and support a more forgiving experience.)
