459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 244 0 R
/E (For this project I will be using React in consultation with the team at Vertixlet. React is a JavaScript library used to build user interfaces for websites and web applications. It lets developers create reusable components: small, self-contained pieces of a page, like buttons, forms, or menus, that can be combined to build complex applications. React makes websites more interactive because it can update only the parts of the page that change, instead of reloading the whole page. I have chosen this platform for the simple reason that I am already familiar with it. It has a big online community and a lot of documentation accessible.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
