/E (The idea was to create a dashboard with two layers for supporters. One layer is for managing their own account, such as editing their name, email, password, or deleting their account. The second layer is for managing the participants linked to their account. Participants themselves only see their own account, which they can edit, and do not have access to the supporter layer.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
