<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 264 0 R
/E (Although not all participants fell strictly within the MCI target group, their symptoms closely overlap with those associated with MCI. Recruiting a test group consisting exclusively of people with MCI would be extremely challenging, as many individuals in this group are not yet under hospital care and may only be in contact with a general practitioner, or not receiving medical support at all.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
