/Pg 43 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
711 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 267 0 R
/E (Reorder the roles so that the Supporter role is presented second. This better aligns with the expected behaviour of both user groups and reduces the likelihood of participants with MCI selecting the wrong role during registration.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
